[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Name=Game controls on/off
Name[ko]=게임 컨트롤 켜기/끄기
Comment=F12: turn the Android game controls on or off (only while Android runs)
Comment[ko]=F12: Android 게임 컨트롤 켜기 또는 끄기 (Android 실행 중에만)
Icon=input-gaming
Exec=/usr/local/bin/delay-game-key controls
StartupNotify=false
X-KDE-Shortcuts=F12